              <p>It’s one home for the agent CLIs you already have: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Grok Build, OpenCode, Antigravity, Pi, Kiro, Muse Code, fx, or any agent that speaks ACP. Each one runs on your own subscription. No new plan, no lock-in.</p>
